  "excerpt": "念佛人得到哪25位「保鏢菩薩」貼身衛護？名單在此！\n         根據經典記載，阿彌陀佛派遣這二十五位菩薩（包括觀世音和大勢至在內），常隨護念專念阿彌陀佛、願生西方極樂世界的行者，一切時處擁護，不令惡鬼惡神得便。\n ",
  "bodyHtml": "<div><!--HTML編輯器或是圖文區塊套用此ID--> <h2>念佛人得到哪25位「保鏢菩薩」貼身衛護？名單在此！</h2> <div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;根據經典記載，阿彌陀佛派遣這二十五位菩薩（包括觀世音和大勢至在內），常隨護念專念阿彌陀佛、願生西方極樂世界的行者，一切時處擁護，不令惡鬼惡神得便。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>完整名單（依經典順序）：</strong></p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1.<strong>觀世音菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2.<strong>大勢至菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3.<strong>藥王菩薩</strong></p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4.<strong>藥上菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5.<strong>普賢菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6.<strong>法自在菩薩</strong>（或法自在王菩薩）</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 7.<strong>師子吼菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 8.<strong>陀羅尼菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 9.<strong>虛空藏菩薩</strong></p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;10.<strong>德藏菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;11. <strong>菩藏菩薩</strong>（或寶藏菩薩）</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;12.<strong>金藏菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;13.<strong>金剛藏菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;14.<strong>山海慧菩薩</strong></p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;15.<strong>光明王菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;16.<strong>華嚴王菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;17.<strong>眾寶王菩薩</strong></p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;18.<strong>月光王菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;19. <strong>日照王菩薩</strong>（或日光王菩薩）</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;20.<strong>三昧王菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;21.<strong>定自在王菩薩&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; 22.<strong>大自在王菩薩</strong></p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;23.<strong>白象王菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;24.<strong>大威德王菩薩</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;25.<strong>無邊身菩薩</strong></p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;此列表源自《十往生經》，經典中強調這些菩薩「如影隨形」、「恆沙諸佛共來護念」，為念佛行者提供周密保護。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;善導大師在<strong>《觀念法門》</strong>中，也有明確提到二十五菩薩護念：</p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"color:#000080\">佛告山海慧菩薩及以阿難：若有人專念西方阿彌陀佛願往生者，我從今已去，常使二十五菩薩影護行者，不令惡鬼惡神惱亂行者，日夜常得安穩。</span></span></p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;此即現生護念增上緣。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>附：</strong>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;以下是日本室町時代（600多年前）宮廷畫師土佐行廣所繪的《二十五菩薩來迎圖》，由小倉山二尊院珍藏：</p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-1.jpg\" /></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">1.<strong>觀世音菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-2.jpg\" /></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">2.<strong>大勢至菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-3.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">3.<strong>藥王菩薩&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>5.<strong>普賢菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-4.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">4.<strong>藥上菩薩&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>6.&nbsp;<strong>法自在菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-7.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>7.<strong>師子吼菩薩&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>8.<strong>陀羅尼菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-9.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">9.<strong>虛空藏菩薩&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>10.<strong>德藏菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-11.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">11.&nbsp;<strong>菩藏菩薩</strong>（或寶藏菩薩）12.<strong>金藏菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-13.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">13.<strong>金剛藏菩薩&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>17.<strong>眾寶王菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-14.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">14.<strong>山海慧菩薩&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>15.<strong>光明王菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-16.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">16.<strong>華嚴王菩薩&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>25.<strong>無邊身菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-18.jpg\" /></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">18.<strong>月光王菩薩&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>20.<strong>三昧王菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-19.jpg\" /></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">19.&nbsp;<strong>日照王菩薩</strong>（或日光王菩薩）24.<strong>大威德王菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-21.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">21.<strong>定自在王菩薩&nbsp;</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-22.jpg\" /></strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">22.<strong>大自在王菩薩</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/images/25Buddha-23.jpg\" /></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p> </div> </div>",
